 div, title or xmp as type-1 closers. TOC controls total707 and em-dash controls57, retaining all earlier controls. Author base/head measurements cover205 GitHub gfm fixtures and all163 tracked pages; reconstructed fixtures, measurements and mutation definitions are published with their original attribution.\n\nAll43 manager static/builder commands and all5 native commands passed on the final head, including55 parent suites/2,118,264 checks, both processor suites, Yosys and BDD. Four declared field-campaign skips contribute0 checks, and physical calibration gate11 remains NOT RUN under the existing deferral. [Complete current native evidence and identity checks](https://github.com/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/pull/507#issuecomment-5774050784).\n\nThe head is ready and its trusted all-four replica is queued behind PR505. Hosted results remain uninspected until the actual runner starts. Cold reviewers R225 internal Codex and R226 external Opus will re-review the corrected head; R226-F1 remains open until then. Standing maintainer authorization permits merge only after two independent positives, clean coverage of all five lenses, required local/hosted gates and current candidate validation. Post-merge containment remains required before Done.\n","created_at":"2026-09-22T05:47:56Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T09:38:38Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"8e62fec1b1992eb1aff35021eaeb9b72d8b589c0","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/pulls/507/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/pulls/507/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/issues/507/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kebag-logic/milan-fpga/statuses/9d6109ccf924c03308cb8aa20